    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7469,
        "name": "摩拉克斯",
        "desc": "<p>璃月的岩神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/12/368338997/8e662b610f4bd4eaefa43643379094db_5800295406074082258.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 46,
        "name": "鍾離",
        "desc": "被「往生堂」請來的神祕客人，知識淵博，對各種事物都頗有見地。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/character/Zhongli_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "語音"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>關於白馬仙人</color> <color=#ffd680>...</color>\n白馬，白馬 ... 這位仙人，其實也是我許久未見的一位故人。只可嘆，春夜短，秋日速，隙過駒，風過燭。"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 24,
        "name": "煙緋",
        "desc": "活躍在璃月港的知名律法諮詢師，混有仙獸血脈的精明少女。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/character/Yanfei_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "對話"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>關於菈烏瑪</color>\n（詠月使？聽著怪怪的…姥姥說，之前確實有一位仙人和月亮有關，但那位仙人應該不是詠月使…吧…）"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8396,
        "name": "菈烏瑪",
        "desc": "被月光與森林祝福的聖女，一個誕生在「霜月之子」中的希望。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/09/08/b06e9ff48d57de4856f1a05b1199aae1_8565150401481594895.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "對話"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd680>關於煙緋</color>\n是麼？那是最好。但…這位仙人小姐在談到璃月傳說時，曾提到了一位與月有關的「白馬仙人」。\n若是我沒記錯，「霜月之子」的典籍中，亦有記載一位曾經身居月上的神使。"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "人物關係"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7083,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "茲白是",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4897,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "所創造的天使之一。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7625,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "茲白被任命為月使，並獲賜月之輪。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9037,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "是她的同僚。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9355,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "茲白是琅玕古文明的高天使者。人們將她尊奉為社稷神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9095,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在「葬火之戰」期間，天理決意淨化這片受污染的土地，向人類文明降下了寒天之釘。茲白違抗了她的創造者，阻止了靈石，使得部分人們得以逃脫。他們向北部遷徙，最終在",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5118,
        "name": "沉玉谷",
        "desc": "<p>伴隨著輕柔的微風，馥郁的茶香再度飄遍璃月的高原。<br>「茗生此中石，玉泉流不歇。」清微淡遠的芬芳與古時的玉玦歌一同拂過翹英莊的河川，直至熙來攘往的遺瓏埠。南方霧氣氤氳的山嶺間，不知又隱藏著什麼樣的奇遇…</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/04/19/142453215/c3b05f550a4a993a64548c995c9ab98c_3837158172616331798.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 20
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "找到了容身之地。茲白也因此隕落了。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4898,
        "name": "伊斯塔露",
        "desc": "<p>時之執政，又稱為常世大神、「千風與日月」、卡伊洛斯和「不變世界的統領與執政」。她是原初的那一位影子之一。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/12/14/368338997/64766912ce2750152a3d4787f937e178_6450576765130499896.jpg",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在茲白死去的前一刻，時之執政凝固了她三個破碎的靈魂本源，並將它們分別置於天使的三尸神體內。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7469,
        "name": "摩拉克斯",
        "desc": "<p>璃月的岩神。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/12/368338997/8e662b610f4bd4eaefa43643379094db_5800295406074082258.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "茲白的老朋友，教了她斬三尸。在她死後的六千年，摩拉克斯復活了她。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5102,
        "name": "仙人",
        "desc": "<p>仙人是一群生活在提瓦特的不朽之物，千年來一直保護著璃月的人們。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/03/17/157749474/7372a2d1b47769b64d0e87bd21a867a7_1916279790302197166.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 23
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "雖然茲白擁有仙人的稱號，但這並非仙人的統治者授予，而是由人民授予的。\n茲踞\n茲躓\n茲蹻\n茲白的三尸神。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相關任務"
      },
